JS8 Normal recordings from JS8Call-improved's own decoder tests
(https://github.com/JS8Call-improved/JS8Call-improved, media/tests/,
GPL-3.0), 12 kHz mono, 15 s: real traffic, heartbeats and directed
messages.  JS8Call names them {MODE}_{DEPTH}_{EXPECTED_DECODES}: A is
Normal; the depth is how hard JS8Call's decoder tries.

A_2_1 carries one frame of compressed (JSC) text.

tests/dsp/test_js8_recordings decodes them with radiod's JS8 receiver.
